      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Personalized marketing support</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ongoing passive income from refills</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Position you as an influencer&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Learn more about how to increase your profits, along with the comparable profitability of online, retail, and private practice sales below.</span></p>",
